UPDATE companies SET description='Coastal Power Systems operates from Tomball, Texas, in the Houston metropolitan area. The company was founded in 1995 as a source for industrial circuit breakers and has since grown into a full-service power systems provider serving customers throughout the United States.

The company manufactures custom power distribution equipment including UL 1558 switchgear, UL 891 switchboards, UL 67 panelboards, medium and low voltage switchgear, and protection and control systems. Beyond manufacturing, Coastal Power Systems delivers engineering and design services, NETA-guided testing and commissioning, preventive maintenance and reliability services, modernization and life extension programs, 24/7 emergency response, and field services for critical electrical infrastructure. This integrated model places engineering, manufacturing, testing, field service, and technical support under one roof.

Coastal Power Systems serves utilities, data centers, power generation facilities, oil and gas operations, petrochemical plants, industrial manufacturers, water and wastewater facilities, transportation infrastructure, commercial facilities, and renewable energy sites. Its customers include EPC firms, consulting engineers, industrial facility owners, and mission-critical operators who require dependable power distribution equipment and lifecycle support.

The company emphasizes a single-source approach that combines engineering, manufacturing, field services, testing, repair, modernization, and technical support within one organization. This integrated structure is intended to provide a single point of responsibility, faster communication, and streamlined project execution from initial design through commissioning, maintenance, modernization, emergency response, and long-term asset management.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["UL 1558 switchgear manufacturing", "UL 891 switchboard manufacturing", "UL 67 panelboard manufacturing", "Medium voltage switchgear manufacturing", "Low voltage switchgear manufacturing", "Protection and control systems manufacturing", "Custom power distribution equipment manufacturing", "Engineering and design services", "Power coordination studies", "Arc flash studies", "Short circuit studies", "Reliability assessments", "Power system design support", "Value engineering", "NETA-guided testing", "Primary injection testing", "Secondary injection testing", "Protective relay testing", "Medium voltage testing", "Commissioning services", "Startup support", "Electrical preventive maintenance", "Circuit breaker inspection, maintenance, and repair", "Full circuit breaker restoration and reconditioning", "Infrared thermography inspections", "Electrical asset management and lifecycle planning", "Protective relay and control system evaluation", "Switchgear and switchboard maintenance", "Motor control center maintenance, repair, and refurbishment", "Circuit breaker retrofits", "Circuit breaker retrofills", "Switchgear modernization", "Arc flash mitigation", "Reliability upgrades", "Obsolete equipment programs", "Asset life extension", "24/7 emergency support", "Emergency equipment replacement", "Outage response", "Temporary power solutions", "Emergency troubleshooting", "Critical infrastructure recovery", "Medium voltage pot testing", "Vacuum bottle integrity testing", "Electri