UPDATE companies SET description='Constant Technologies is headquartered in North Kingstown, Rhode Island. The company has over 40 years of experience in mission-critical command center solutions, though a specific founding year is not disclosed. President Brad Righi leads the organization, which operates as a global provider of integrated operations centers.

The firm designs, manufactures, and installs complete command and control environments, including video wall systems, specialized console workstations, and audiovisual integration. Its in-house capabilities span architecture, systems engineering, product engineering, and manufacturing, with a certified design team comprising AIA-certified architects and CTS-D-accredited A/V engineers. Constant manages projects from discovery through commissioning and provides 24/7 global support. The company reports more than 5,000 installations across 20-plus countries, with a multinational network of offices and partner locations.

Constant serves technology, finance, public safety, utility, government, healthcare, fleet operations, brand protection, and retail sectors. Named clients include Meta, CVS Health, Boeing, and the U.S. Department of Defense, along with numerous police departments and public safety agencies such as the Albany Police Department and Aurora Police Department.

The company emphasizes its unwavering dedication to quality as a differentiator, citing a robust quality management system and a culture that prioritizes workmanship. Its proven process — discovery, design, execution, commissioning, and ongoing support — is intended to deliver reliable, high-performing centers that operate continuously under mission-critical demands.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Command center design and planning", "Video wall system integration", "Control room furniture manufacturing", "A/V system engineering and programming", "Console workstation design and manufacturing", "Project management and installation", "Commissioning and operator training", "24/7 service and support", "Preventative maintenance contracts", "Site surveys and engineered drawings", "Racking and cabling infrastructure", "Display wall system testing and programming"], "industries": ["Technology", "Finance", "Public Safety", "Utility Operations", "Government", "Healthcare", "Fleet Operations", "Brand Protection", "Retail", "Defense"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["LED video wall systems", "Display wall systems", "Console workstations"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["40+ years dedicated to mission-critical command centers", "5,000+ installations in 20+ countries", "In-house manufacturing of console workstations", "AIA-certified architects and CTS-D-accredited A/V engineers on staff", "24/7 global service and support network"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: North Kingstown, Rhode Island -> db", "40+ years experience -> /, /about", "5,000+ installations -> /, /about", "20+ countries -> /, /about", "President: Brad Righi -> /about", "VP Project Engineering: Danny Sasseville (CTS-D AIA) -> /about, /quality", "Principal Support Analyst: Ryan Wolstencroft -> /services", "Clients: Meta, CVS Health, Boeing, U.S. Department of Defense -> /about", "Industries served: Technology, Finance, Public Safety, Utility Operations, 