UPDATE companies SET description='Control Freaks Hawaii Inc. operates from its headquarters in Kahului, Hawaii, with a second location in Kurtistown on the Big Island. The company serves residential and commercial clients across the Hawaiian Islands, with a primary focus on Maui and additional coverage on the Big Island, Lanai, Molokai, Oahu, and Kauai. No founding year or founder names are disclosed in public materials.

The firm designs and installs integrated technology systems for homes and businesses. Its service portfolio includes smart home automation, multi-room music, home theater, lighting control, motorized window treatments, commercial automation, home security, and outdoor entertainment. Control Freaks Hawaii collaborates with builders, architects, and designers from the early design phase to embed lighting, shading, audio, and network plans into projects.

Clients range from luxury homeowners and second-home owners to hospitality operators, condo associations, and trade professionals. The company explicitly mentions partnerships with hotels and spas, and its commercial automation work targets hospitality and condo automation systems. Builders, architects, and designers are engaged as trade partners through a referral program.

Control Freaks Hawaii emphasizes trust, craftsmanship, and local presence as differentiators. It holds Home Technology Association (HTA) certification, a third-party evaluation of technical qualification and client care, and maintains a Hawaii contractor license (CT-35828). The firm promotes personalized design, 24/7 support options, and fast service turnarounds rooted in community connections.', certifications=ARRAY['HTA Certified (Home Technology Association)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Smart home automation", "Multi-room music systems", "Home theater design and installation", "Lighting control", "Motorized window treatments", "Commercial automation", "Home security systems", "Outdoor entertainment systems", "Network planning and integration", "Consultation and system design", "Installation and integration", "Ongoing support and maintenance packages"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Hospitality", "Condo automation", "Luxury home", "Trade professionals (builders, architects, designers)"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Control4", "Crestron", "Lutron", "Sonos", "Ketra"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["HTA Certified by the Home Technology Association", "Partners with builders, architects, and designers from early design phase", "Multiple post-installation support package options", "Service across all major Hawaiian Islands", "Hawaii contractor license CT-35828"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters at 52 Paa St, Kahului, HI 96732 and Kurtistown office at 17-435 Hale Pule Loop, Kurtistown, HI 96760 -> /", "Service areas: Maui, Big Island, Lanai, Molokai, Oahu, Kauai -> /", "Services: smart home automation, multi-room music, home theater, lighting control, commercial automation, motorized shades, home security, outdoor entertainment -> /", "Partners with builders, architects, designers from early design phase -> /", "HTA Certified company -> /", "Contractor License #CT-35828 -> /", "Brands installed: Control4, Sonos, C