UPDATE companies SET description='Copeland Furniture Factory Outlet operates in Bradford, Vermont, as the direct retail arm of Copeland Furniture, a company that has been designing and manufacturing natural hardwood furniture for over 50 years. The business uses hardwoods sustainably harvested in the Northeast, though the exact founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed.

The outlet showcases the manufacturer’s full range of bedroom, dining, living room, and home office collections, along with factory seconds marked down due to cosmetic flaws. In addition to its own hardwood pieces, the store stocks Italian mattresses.

Customers include residential buyers across Northern New England and other regions not covered by Copeland’s dealer network, as well as interior designers who qualify for the company’s Designer Program. The outlet serves both walk-in shoppers and trade clients seeking sustainable, domestically produced hardwood furniture.

Copeland emphasizes clean design, fine quality, and value, positioning its products as durable pieces meant to last generations. The factory-outlet model allows the company to offer seconds and discontinued styles at a substantial discount while maintaining control over design and production.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Hardwood furniture design", "Wood furniture manufacturing", "Finishing", "Assembly", "Sustainable hardwood sourcing", "Retail showroom", "Factory seconds sales", "Designer trade program"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Home furnishings", "Interior design", "Retail furniture"], "materials": ["Natural hardwoods", "Sustainably harvested Northeast hardwoods"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Clean design, fine quality, and value", "Factory seconds at substantial discount", "Italian mattresses selection", "Designer Program for qualified designers", "Sustainably harvested Northeast hardwoods"], "facts_used": ["Located in Bradford, Vermont -> /", "Designs and manufactures natural hardwood furniture for over 50 years -> /", "Uses sustainably harvested hardwoods from the Northeast -> /", "Operates a factory outlet store selling bedroom, dining, living room, home office collections -> /", "Sells factory seconds at a discount -> /", "Carries high-quality Italian mattresses -> /", "Serves Northern New England and other areas not served by a dealer -> /", "Offers a Designer Program for qualified designers -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Copeland Furniture has been designing and manufacturing natural hardwood furniture for over 50 years", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='copeland-furniture-factory-outlet' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Corner Woodworks operates from Manchester, Maryland. The company does not disclose its founding year, ownership structure, or the names of its founders.

The shop produces custom furniture, cabinetry, millwork, and butcher-block countertops using solid hardwoods and modern joinery techniques. Finishes are hand-rubbed oils that penetrate the wood rather than forming a surface film like polyurethane or conversion varnish. The company states it never uses veneers over fiberboard, and all items are made in the United States.

The firm collaborates on design with each customer, building to order or to suit specific spatial requirements.

