UPDATE companies SET description='Country Snacks Manufacturing, doing business as Carolina Country Snacks, operates a snack food production facility in Henderson, North Carolina. The company specializes in pork-based snacks cooked daily on site.

The plant produces pork rinds, pork skins, popcorn cracklins, pork rind strips, and fatback skins. Pork rind strips and popcorn cracklins are processed to achieve a crunchier texture than traditional puffed rinds. Products include Old Time Fatback Skins and sweet and mild BBQ cracklins, all marketed as low-carbohydrate options containing less than 1% carbs. Snacks are packaged in 1.75-ounce bags and sold online in cases of 12 or 24 bags.

The company serves consumers following low-carb diets such as Atkins, as well as home cooks who incorporate pork rinds into recipes. Direct-to-consumer online sales are the primary channel, with no mention of wholesale or foodservice distribution in the available information.

